{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"JLSEC-2026-1030","published":"2026-07-30T16:02:27.435Z","modified":"2026-07-30T18:35:59.952441025Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-53462","EUVD-2026-36189","GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2"],"summary":"ImageMagick has a Use-After-Free when allocation in CheckPrimitiveExtent fails","details":"ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25, when an allocation fails in CheckPrimitiveExtent this can result in a heap-use-after-free and result in a crash. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ImageMagick_jll","ecosystem":"Julia","purl":"pkg:julia/ImageMagick_jll?uuid=c73af94c-d91f-53ed-93a7-00f77d67a9d7"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.1.2028+0"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/JuliaLang/SecurityAdvisories.jl/tree/generated/osv/2026/JLSEC-2026-1030.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/dlemstra/Magick.NET/releases/tag/14.14.0"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53462"}],"database_specific":{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","sources":[{"database_specific":{"status":"Analyzed"},"html_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53462","id":"CVE-2026-53462","imported":"2026-07-30T14:08:47.879Z","modified":"2026-07-23T09:10:00.113Z","published":"2026-06-10T23:16:50.580Z","url":"https://services.nvd.nist.gov/rest/json/cves/2.0?cveId=CVE-2026-53462"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2","id":"GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2","imported":"2026-07-30T14:09:31.936Z","modified":"2026-06-26T16:21:38Z","published":"2026-06-26T16:21:36Z","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-px7q-ggqj-hcf2"},{"html_url":"https://euvd.enisa.europa